DECF 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03175                     PSHU  D
DED1 BDDCAB           (    forth6809.asm):03176                     JSR   CODECOMMA
DED4 DC0A             (    forth6809.asm):03177                     LDD   VARHERE
DED6 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03178                     PSHU  D
