                      (    forth6809.asm):03324         ; up. A found word is executed, or compiled when STATE is compile and
                      (    forth6809.asm):03325         ; it is not immediate. Anything else is converted as a single or
                      (    forth6809.asm):03326         ; double number (compiled as literals when compiling). An unknown word
                      (    forth6809.asm):03327         ; is typed and THROW -13 is raised.
                      (    forth6809.asm):03328         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
