                      (    forth6809.asm):04888         ; Run-time end of LOOP. Called by JSR; the return address points at
                      (    forth6809.asm):04889         ; the back-branch operand. Add 1 to the index. If the leave flag is
                      (    forth6809.asm):04890         ; set or the index has reached the limit, discard the loop frame and
                      (    forth6809.asm):04891         ; skip the operand; otherwise branch back to the loop start.
                      (    forth6809.asm):04892         ; DOTEST
